WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:14.350
Settings and connections: your business profile, country and currency, contact channels, payment methods and connections. Each item is tested, and only verified ones are shown to customers.

2
00:00:14.901 --> 00:00:24.450
In Business profile, set the brand name, country, currency, time zone, reply languages and the assistant's tone, then save.

3
00:00:25.005 --> 00:00:34.140
In Contact channels, enter the phone, WhatsApp, Telegram, email and website, and save each one with Save and test.

4
00:00:34.691 --> 00:00:43.590
In Payment methods, turn on bank transfer, a payment link or a gateway. Each one has its own step-by-step guide beside it.

5
00:00:44.142 --> 00:00:50.400
What the customer sees now shows what is verified. Test all checks everything again.

6
00:00:50.955 --> 00:00:57.950
An item that failed its test is not shown to customers. Read the error, and fix exactly that.
